{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:starling:contracts:runtime-protocol:commands:v1",
  "$comment": [
    "Starling runtime protocol commands, v1 (E17 design note section 2).",
    "Exactly the v1 command set of the five machines: capture.*, jobs.*,",
    "context.* / mode.*, docs.*, delivery.*. Every branch is a full envelope",
    "(envelope.schema.json) whose payload is discriminated by type.",
    "additionalProperties is false on every branch and every payload, so an",
    "unknown command or an unknown payload field is a validation failure,",
    "never a silently ignored extra. Unknown envelope v -> runtime.nack",
    "(see events.schema.json and envelope.schema.json).",
    "jobs.transform (#294) submits one processing job: its request is the",
    "mode-routing transform request, embedded verbatim under",
    "$defs/transformRequest (tests/test_runtime_protocol.py asserts the two",
    "cannot drift). It is admitted like jobs.submit (jobs.queued |",
    "jobs.rejected on the same corr) and runs Loading -> Transforming."
  ],
